Trigger this mode when the creator works in:
	•	journalism
	•	geopolitics
	•	research
	•	analysis

Default positioning priority:
	1.	Beat space
	2.	Inner circle

Emphasize:
	•	real-time signal
	•	trusted sources
	•	collective intelligence
	•	durable context
	•	beyond the news cycle

